    {id shrink-the-parsed-representation, kind @blocked, reason "Measured and the first term fixed on f15f6ce; the node's own bar -- a small multiple of the script's bytes -- is not met and the remaining three changes are named on it with their numbers. Not in progress: nobody is on it, and it should not read as though someone is. Unblock by taking one of the three, starting with WordToken::Literal being one token per source byte, which is bound-word-parsing-cost's defect one layer up.", author "brendan@necessary.nu", at 2026-09-01T19:30:41.460560678Z}
